OL,3,GNEWSAJury shown CCTV of student being
OL,4,Afatally stabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootage of the moment a university
OL,7,Fstudent was stabbed to death by his
OL,8,Fhousemate has been played to a jury.
OL,10,FCCTV footage was shown at Bristol Crown
OL,11,FCourt showing Zack Coughlan, 23,
OL,12,Fdressed in black and wearing a mask to
OL,13,Fambush and stab Jamie Collins, 21, in
OL,14,Fthe garden of the student house they
OL,15,Fshared in Filton, near Bristol, on 8
OL,16,FApril.
OL,18,FThe footage also shows him in the days
OL,19,Fleading up to the killing as he bought
OL,20,Fthe clothing he later wore during the
OL,21,Fstabbing.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
